From 8560ea57d56c6330c60fdbaef4d68fdc77bb0c55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gddhd059 <gddhd059@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:41:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] arm64: dts: mediatek: add Redmi K50 (rubens) board port

Device tree work for the Xiaomi Redmi K50 (rubens, MT6895) mainline
port: display (l11a dsc-cmd panel), touchscreen, UFS, USB, WiFi/BT,
PMIC keys, charger and the baseband wiring as far as it works today.
---
 .../dts/mediatek/mt6895-xiaomi-rubens.dts     | 4684 +++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 3681 insertions(+), 1003 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6895-xiaomi-rubens.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6895-xiaomi-rubens.dts
index a93ffb81b087..41bff99ac8b0 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6895-xiaomi-rubens.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6895-xiaomi-rubens.dts
@@ -1,1337 +1,4015 @@
